{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月23日，智譜正式發佈GLM-5.4，這是其首代採用Loop Transformer架構的旗艦模型。官方稱，該模型在參數量不變的情況下，通過讓一組共享權重的層循環執行，獲得更深的推理能力，智能水平達到2-3T級模型效果。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587636.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T12:03:50.892365+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T11:49:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T11:57:10.447429+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T11:57:10.447429+00:00","content_hash":"fdc7ce7c9b8dea3f32777757904563a5094f89cf557219b0dd8cd1002b0e632c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}